{"4972920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Celestial City", "steam_appid": 4972920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Celestial City* is not a solemn cultivation epic. It is a neon-drenched immortal city where sects run on performance metrics, ascension has a waiting list, merit can be financed, and the top grinders glow on public leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/5957efa2c590afe93f9c54e33b2d4000.avif?t=1785975720\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run sends you into contested zones to scavenge cyber relics, pillware, merit assets, and rare loot. When you meet other players, you can fight, hide, cooperate for a moment, or look extremely busy while taking another route to extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/0b3fbae1f656c4bd57b6587672229584.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/0b3fbae1f656c4bd57b6587672229584.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is not about grinding the hardest or killing everyone. It is about knowing when the run has become profitable enough. Your bag is full, your enemies are close, and extraction is open. Push for one more relic, or clock out with the loot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Dark-Comedy Cultivation**: Ascension, sects, merit, and overwork become an absurd but readable battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/12a3a393d541ffbf41e9b000be01fe70.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/12a3a393d541ffbf41e9b000be01fe70.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Cyberpunk Immortal City**: Neon formations, data flying swords, merit loans, and sect KPIs share the same skyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/df3b3d602a2fbfe75708c6d0213ece5a.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/df3b3d602a2fbfe75708c6d0213ece5a.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Loot-Fight-Extract Loop**: Search for resources, survive encounters, steal rewards, and extract alive to make it count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/d8c79802fbbad53dd191456e15ebeda8.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/d8c79802fbbad53dd191456e15ebeda8.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Anti-Rat-Race Fantasy**: You do not have to be the top grinder. Slacking off, flanking, ambushing, and leaving on time are valid strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/c6cc114f247d41f02dc4c93837382a6f.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/c6cc114f247d41f02dc4c93837382a6f.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Fast, Impactful Skirmishes**: Short, readable, explosive fights where winning feels good and escaping feels even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Celestial City* is not a solemn cultivation epic. It is a neon-drenched immortal city where sects run on performance metrics, ascension has a waiting list, merit can be financed, and the top grinders glow on public leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/5957efa2c590afe93f9c54e33b2d4000.avif?t=1785975720\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run sends you into contested zones to scavenge cyber relics, pillware, merit assets, and rare loot. When you meet other players, you can fight, hide, cooperate for a moment, or look extremely busy while taking another route to extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/0b3fbae1f656c4bd57b6587672229584.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/0b3fbae1f656c4bd57b6587672229584.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is not about grinding the hardest or killing everyone. It is about knowing when the run has become profitable enough. Your bag is full, your enemies are close, and extraction is open. Push for one more relic, or clock out with the loot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >## Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Dark-Comedy Cultivation**: Ascension, sects, merit, and overwork become an absurd but readable battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/12a3a393d541ffbf41e9b000be01fe70.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/12a3a393d541ffbf41e9b000be01fe70.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Cyberpunk Immortal City**: Neon formations, data flying swords, merit loans, and sect KPIs share the same skyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/df3b3d602a2fbfe75708c6d0213ece5a.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/df3b3d602a2fbfe75708c6d0213ece5a.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Loot-Fight-Extract Loop**: Search for resources, survive encounters, steal rewards, and extract alive to make it count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/d8c79802fbbad53dd191456e15ebeda8.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/d8c79802fbbad53dd191456e15ebeda8.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Anti-Rat-Race Fantasy**: You do not have to be the top grinder. Slacking off, flanking, ambushing, and leaving on time are valid strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras/c6cc114f247d41f02dc4c93837382a6f.avif?t=1785975720\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/extras_big/c6cc114f247d41f02dc4c93837382a6f.webp?t=1785975720 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- **Fast, Impactful Skirmishes**: Short, readable, explosive fights where winning feels good and escaping feels even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "*Celestial City* is a dark-comedy cyber-cultivation extraction game. Enter a neon immortal city ruled by sect KPIs, merit loans, and ascension anxiety. Scavenge relics, fight hard, and extract on time. If you cannot out-grind them, loot smarter and leave alive.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, Japanese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/0087ee3cf8909308e6199c0a4ea3db8f1ed21b46/header.jpg?t=1785975720", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/2cbd46cf1acb74049e383d918d94ea18d1d5ade1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785975720", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972920/2cbd46cf1acb74049e383d918d94ea18d1d5ade1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785975720", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I5 12600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1066<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I9 14700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 64 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 5090<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["JZHL"], "publishers": ["JZHL"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id":